## Archival rules

This dive becomes archived when:
- Its findings are folded into one of the 10 topic markdowns, AND
- Nothing in the dive is being actively referenced for >6 months

When archived, leave the file in `deep_dives/` but change Status to `archived` and add a one-line note: "Findings absorbed into knowledge/<topic>.md (date)."
